<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Gender-Neutral Rewriting in Italian: Models, Approaches, and Trade-offs</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author"><span class="ltx_annotated_personname">
