<td id="S2.T1.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt"><span id="S2.T1.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">Spero di essere <span id="S2.T1.2.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">stato chiaro</span> su questo punto.</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S2.T1.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S2.T1.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><span id="S2.T1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">EN</span></td>
<td id="S2.T1.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><span id="S2.T1.2.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">I hope that I am clear in this.</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S2.T1.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
