<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 6: </span>Sentence-similarity results of the few-shot prompting experiments. The best model settings are <span id="A1.T6.6" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">underlined</span>, the best settings across the categories are <span id="A1.T6.7" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#A5FDDA;">highlighted</span>, and the best overall performer is in <span id="A1.T6.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bold</span>.</figcaption>
